        "narration": "In August 1994, mysterious translucent gel rained down over Oakville, Washington.",
        "visual_query": "1990s small town suburban street",
        "visual_fallback": "foggy small town"
      },
      {
        "narration": "One resident reported that she and her mother felt ill after the blobs fell, and speculated that it caused her kitten's death.",
